-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components and data (see README "Licences"):
- The trained models in public/models/ are derived from the FUNSD dataset,
  which is licensed for non-commercial research and education only. The models
  and this app must not be used commercially.
- Two sample images in public/samples/ (form-*.png) come from the FUNSD test set
  (same non-commercial licence). The specimen-*.jpg images are synthetic,
  labelled as specimens, and use fictional data (ICAO Doc 9303 sample holder).
- PP-OCRv5 models in public/models/ppocr (PaddleOCR, Apache-2.0; ONNX conversions
  from github.com/GreatV/oar-ocr and huggingface.co/monkt/paddleocr-onnx).
  MobileCLIP-S0 (Apple, downloaded at runtime) has its own licence: check it before any reuse.
- Arabic recogniser public/models/ppocr/arabic_rec.onnx and arabic_dict.txt: PaddlePaddle
  arabic_PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec (official ONNX, huggingface.co/PaddlePaddle/arabic_PP-OCRv5_mobile_rec_onnx),
  Apache-2.0.
- Corner finder public/models/corner/doccornernet_lean.onnx: DocCornerNet LEAN from the scanic
  project (github.com/marquaye/scanic, MIT; architecture from github.com/mapo80/DocCornerNet-CoordClass, MIT).
- Tesseract / tesseract.js: Apache-2.0. ONNX Runtime Web: MIT.
  Transformers.js: Apache-2.0. Florence-2-base-ft: MIT (downloaded at runtime).
